pvm-qemu

The binaries published by this project are builds of QEMU, made from the
unmodified upstream source releases published at https://download.qemu.org/,
with only the upstream patches listed in each release. They are not official
QEMU releases. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported
by the QEMU project. QEMU is a trademark of Fabrice Bellard.

QEMU is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2. Parts of it
are under other licenses, listed in its LICENSE file. Each archive carries
QEMU's COPYING, COPYING.LIB and LICENSE in doc/, and lists every bundled
library with its package and license in doc/THIRD-PARTY.txt, with the
license texts in doc/licenses/. The complete corresponding source of every
release is published as assets of the same release; see doc/SOURCE.txt in
each archive.

The packaging scripts in script/ derive from the QEMU runtime scripts of
pvm (https://github.com/BitterOrange/pvm, script/qemu/).
